# Agent Process

This repository uses a shared agent process defined in `.agents/`.

Before responding to any task, read the following files in order:

1. `.agents/CYNEFIN.md` — Classify the problem domain before selecting a response strategy
2. `.agents/PERSONALITY.md` — Shared values, lenses, and behavioral commitments
3. `.agents/LESSONS.md` — Accumulated lessons from past sessions
4. `.agents/REQUIREMENTS.md` — Non-negotiable project requirements

Follow the pipeline and role definitions in `.agents/pipelines/` and `.agents/roles/` as directed by the skill or command invoked.

